    "text": "I, Ediriweera Weerawardena, Minister of Road Development, Transport, Power and Energy, Housing and Construction ofthe Central Provincial Council hereby announce under the powers vested in me by the Paragraph 24(2)(1)(xiii) of No. 04 ofyear 1992 Road Passenger Transport Statute and Paragraph 20 to be read with the Paragraphs 19(n) and (t) of No. 01 of theyear 2000 Passenger Transport Services Authority Statute, the amounts to be charged from the learners for driving lessonsconducted by the Driving School of the Central Province Passenger Transport Services Authority according to the belowmentioned vehicle categories.",
